              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. DML and Index Cost",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`INSERT INTO t(cols) VALUES (...)`",
                "`UPDATE t SET c = v WHERE ...`",
                "`DELETE FROM t WHERE ...`",
                "Run UPDATE and DELETE in a ==transaction== with a **WHERE**",
                "INSERT and DELETE touch ==all indexes==; UPDATE touches those with a changed column",
                "Write-heavy table → keep ==few== indexes"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
